  "translation": "U-Akhazi inkosi wamyalela ⟨את⟩ uUriya umongami, wathi: “Phezu kwe-altare enkulu thatha idini lokunyuswa lokusa ⟨את⟩ nesipho sokuhlwa ⟨את⟩, idini lokunyuswa lenkosi ⟨את⟩ nesipho sayo ⟨את⟩, idini lokunyuswa lomntu wonke welizwe ⟨את⟩, nesipho sabo neeselo zabo; yonke igazi ledini lokunyuswa nolonke igazi lesibulwa, phezu kwayo uchithe; i-altare yebhodloza iba yeyokubuzisa mna.”",
